{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>哈利波特迷係時候出動喇！人氣店「再睡 5 分鐘」將於 10月27日推出《哈利波特》跨界聯乘「霍格華茲課程系列」！今次以四大經典課程為靈感，打造出4款夢幻特飲。只需$59組合價，就可以一口氣入手特飲連限定變色隨行杯！4款主題特飲包括以飛行課為靈感嘅「焦糖布丁歐蕾🍮」、藥草學「桂花仙草歐蕾🌿」、魔咒學「葡萄藍柑沙沙🍇」以及奇獸學「蘋果莓莓沙沙🍎」。</p><p>只要購買任一主題飲品，仲可以不限組數加購多款質感爆燈嘅限定周邊（$69 起），推介手感極佳嘅毛茸茸「怪獸書 14 吋筆電包」同埋神還原嘅「光輪 2000 兩用抱枕毯」！活動於 2026 年 10 月 27 日在全港再睡 5 分鐘門市正式開賣，各位巫師同麻瓜們記得準時去掃貨全套收藏喇！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179251202431041794_13943995226ad790187f68b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179251202596892129_18842131906ad7901a26cfe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179251202764951967_1151431516ad7901bc05c0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179251202902311398_8804740266ad7901d2d77f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T17:39:13.477839+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T19:37:46.251203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T17:37:39.179713+00:00","content_hash":"2569d6064177646e726b81b5262dde8d3e31c3f233125072d4cf2b49215fff38","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}